EmailTemplate.textOnly:
Dear {!Contact.FirstName},

Congratulations on your admission to Arizona State University! You can view ASU's steps to enroll for more information about your next steps.

All new students must submit their MMR immunization records and schedule an advising appointment before they register for classes. Your MMR immunization records should be sent to ASU Health Services; the fax number is 480-965-8914. Your academic advisor's information is located on your My ASU page. Please make sure to schedule an advising appointment so your academic advisor can help you in the registration process.

View our course catalog online. Visit the academic calendar for important dates. If you are no longer interested in attending ASU, please officially decline your admission.

Let me know if you have any questions.

{!User.Recruiter_Full_Name__c}
Admission Services
{!User.Recruiter_Title__c}
{!User.Recruiter_Email__c}
{!User.Recruiter_Phone__c}

If you have any additional information or questions related to this, please reply to this email.

{!Case.Thread_Id}
